&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Remote - Anywhere (Open to applicants located anywhere around the globe)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria’s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great design doesn&#39;t just look good — it changes how people feel about a product. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; at Fueled, you’ll shape that feeling across some of the most interesting digital products being built right now, designing primarily for mobile-first and native app experiences used by millions of people.&amp;nbsp;You won&#39;t be handed a brief and told to execute. You&#39;ll be there from the very beginning, asking hard questions, pushing for clarity, and helping teams figure out what they&#39;re actually building before anyone writes a line of code. Then you&#39;ll see it through to launch, iteration, and everything in between — helping teams move faster and make better decisions along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intentionally remote and globally distributed across six continents, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we’re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product design end-to-end for complex mobile apps and digital products — iOS, Android, responsive web, the whole stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead early discovery, defining interaction models, building scalable design systems, and sweating the final details before something ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate messy constraints (business goals, technical realities, real user behavior) into experiences that feel obvious in the best possible way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers, engineers, researchers, and clients — not just handing off specs, but genuinely collaborating and facilitating conversations that shape product direction. You’ll help teams make better decisions together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will achieve:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver products that users actually want to use — intuitive, polished, and built around real needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring calm and momentum to ambiguous situations, helping everyone around you feel more confident about where you&#39;re headed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate the thinking behind your design decisions clearly, helping teams and stakeholders understand not just what was built, but why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams identify the right problems to solve before jumping to solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for users — relentlessly — so that the products you ship feel genuinely useful, not just well-designed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve spent 4+ years designing complex products and you&#39;re comfortable owning them — the good parts and the hard ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re not afraid of ambiguity; you know how to create structure where there isn&#39;t any.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make design decisions based on research and evidence, not gut feelings or personal taste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead through collaboration and clear communication, not title.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know when to keep refining and when to ship it — because you care about outcomes as much as craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Contractor Fee&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation is determined based on a variety of factors including relevant experience, projects, geographic location, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Join our Contractor Pool&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed as a contract position, offering you the opportunity to experience our team and culture while showcasing your contributions. When the fit and business needs align, some contractors are invited to explore a transition into full-time roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about Fueled’s mission and think you have what it takes to be successful in this role, even if you don’t check all the boxes – please apply. We’d appreciate the opportunity to review your application. Everyone gets a response.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upon meeting the necessary criteria, you’ll join the Fueled contractor network, granting you access to project invitations tailored to your expertise and availability when they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
