&lt;li&gt;Develop and grow a team of GTM enablement roles over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track program effectiveness and continuously improve based on feedback and performance data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
