&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with and troubleshooting PostgreSQL and/or MySQL in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting database-related issues in one of your previous roles—whether as a DBA, backend engineer, SRE, or any position where you&#39;ve debugged slow queries, optimized indexes, or resolved production database problems&lt;/li&gt;
