&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate database optimization services in Go and C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop features for query analysis, index recommendations, and automated performance tuning that deliver measurable database cost savings.&lt;/li&gt;
